{"data": [{"author_id": "2036016090405593088", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:26:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118485178238800343"], "id": "2118485178238800343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 851, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国民政部刚刚公布的数据显示：2026年前三季度，全国结婚登记仅有464.8万对。今年就算600万对吧，明年出生人口五百万了不得了，中国出生人口数快接近美国了！但是总人口中国是美国的三四倍", "url": "https://x.com/GuiShaDui/status/2118485178238800343"}, {"author_id": "1239341587555115014", "created_at": "2026-11-07T06:13:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118949900805353500"], "id": "2118949900805353500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 113, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新出生人口规模，掉的太快！\n\n2025年，我国新出生人口降至792万人，首破800万关口，较2016年峰值近乎腰斩。\n\n据多方预测，2026年新生儿数据可能继续下跌超5%，，跌破750万关口，尚未见底。 https://t.co/fdTChD1Vh1", "url": "https://x.com/Huluwa678/status/2118949900805353500"}, {"author_id": "1834294976064487425", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:05:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118615819076956578"], "id": "2118615819076956578", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "看这个结婚数据，预估一下今明两年的新出生人口数\n\n2026年跌破750万，\n2027年跌破700万。\n\n2025年确定约792万的出生人口规模，已倒退至清朝乾隆三年(1738年/1739年)的水平，而当时的全国总人口数仅为约1.5亿。 https://t.co/UVyxaXJcSs", "url": "https://x.com/hchfgd53296/status/2118615819076956578"}, {"author_id": "1857139445532618752", "created_at": "2026-11-07T02:12:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118889352004809200"], "id": "2118889352004809200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 297, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新出生人口掉的真快\n怎么都不生了 https://t.co/W1KiK67KYG", "url": "https://x.com/chensikey/status/2118889352004809200"}, {"author_id": "1006082493659746304", "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:38:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118533368140968096"], "id": "2118533368140968096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "民政部 11 月 4 日公布：今年前三季度全国结婚登记 464.8 万对，比去年同期少了 50.4 万对，跌了 9.78%；离婚 208.2 万对，离结比 44.8%。\n结婚少了，出生人口明年大概率跟着往下走——去年出生人口已经只有 792 万。更麻烦的是结构：10 后、20 后的人数比 00", "url": "https://x.com/tuscan_moon/status/2118533368140968096"}, {"author_id": "1126698901807828994", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:25:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118515096704229436"], "id": "2118515096704229436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国前三季度新生儿（出生人口）是多少。\n分开统计各省的信息\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/John_DarcyJD/status/2118515096704229436"}, {"author_id": "2377118497", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:19:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118845708052877547"], "id": "2118845708052877547", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 340, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "日本人终于肯生孩子啦！！！\n\n本质上是东京一个地方支撑了日本全国的人口出生率！！！\n\n日本厚生劳动省公布最新数据：\n\n2026年上半年，日本全国出生人口达到320458人，同比增长0.4%。\n\n这是日本11年来首次实现上半年出生人口同比增长！！！\n\n其中，东京出生人口41745人，同比增长4.7%，增加了1864人。 https://t.co/GO4OzJePZG", "url": "https://x.com/tokyo_feng/status/2118845708052877547"}, {"author_id": "1554575293264072705", "created_at": "2026-11-06T12:09:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118677095337644411"], "id": "2118677095337644411", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1229, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "韩国，日本的出生人口一直在暴跌\n\n以后会不会立法，最少必须生一个\n\n否则强制婚配，强制生育？", "url": "https://x.com/aronhouyu/status/2118677095337644411"}, {"author_id": "1367943697279705090", "created_at": "2026-11-06T07:18:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118603909858312290"], "id": "2118603909858312290", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 24098, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118459577369006090", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "请易富贤老师预测一下，中国的出生人口跌到啥时候才能稳定下来？可能是下个世纪的事儿了。 https://t.co/OgYxtUoduy", "url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2118603909858312290"}, {"author_id": "420799590", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:56:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119021182905471358"], "id": "2119021182905471358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "关于中国出生人口趋势，我最直白的总结就是：生一个，少一个。\n\n这是结构性出现严重的错误了。 https://t.co/pB3aVSSbGm", "url": "https://x.com/lituanpeng/status/2119021182905471358"}, {"author_id": "54605379", "created_at": "2026-11-07T06:40:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118956782718701657"], "id": "2118956782718701657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 115, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2050年只有300万左右的出生人口，好可怕，会一年死2000万吧。匪共能执政到那个时候吧，还有24年。", "url": "https://x.com/dancingfun/status/2118956782718701657"}, {"author_id": "2108878139913056256", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:44:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118927446741516560"], "id": "2118927446741516560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年中国新出生人口降至792万人，首次跌破800万关口，较2016年峰值近乎腰斩，人口负增长已进入第四个年头。", "url": "https://x.com/Kylieee0425/status/2118927446741516560"}, {"author_id": "8149482", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:26:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118455028738375887"], "id": "2118455028738375887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 42, "impression_count": 69682, "like_count": 232, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "中国民政部刚刚公布的数据显示：2026年前三季度，全国结婚登记仅有464.8万对。人口学家预测，这意味着2027年的出生人口将暴跌。\nhttps://t.co/upXqehkdMA", "url": "https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2118455028738375887"}, {"author_id": "861236976216944641", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:17:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118618862220677611"], "id": "2118618862220677611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 165, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年前9个月，中国结婚登记\n\n数量同比下降近10%。这意味着\n\n未来出生人口、家庭消费结构和\n\n养老负担，都可能继续受到影\n\n响。", "url": "https://x.com/mecypu/status/2118618862220677611"}, {"author_id": "1583330329238069249", "created_at": "2026-11-07T01:56:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118885302156906863"], "id": "2118885302156906863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "出生人口大幅减少的危害是否可以简单理解为金字塔的塔基在缩小，那就将导致整座金字塔存在坍塌的风险", "url": "https://x.com/dwtreee/status/2118885302156906863"}, {"author_id": "2032320195382165507", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:09:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118510984159777255"], "id": "2118510984159777255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2262, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我实在想不明白。\n\n现在出生人口越来越少，\n\n退休老人却越来越多。\n\n等我们这一代退休的时候，\n\n养老金到底靠谁来支撑？\n\n有没有真正懂的人解释一下？？", "url": "https://x.com/Davidavid139/status/2118510984159777255"}, {"author_id": "1390858034", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:38:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118925953724547341"], "id": "2118925953724547341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新出生人口规模，掉的太快！\n据多方预测，2026年新生儿数据可能继续下跌超5%，，跌破750万关口，尚未见底。 ​\n各位蓝朋友，你们有几个小孩了 https://t.co/HrpuiQI0U7", "url": "https://x.com/whv2014/status/2118925953724547341"}, {"author_id": "1562136801183027200", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:10:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118919080006819878"], "id": "2118919080006819878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 561, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我想了3天3夜也想不通\n\n一个国家，一个社会\n嫌出生人口太少，\n嫌大学生人口太多。\n\n到底是希望年轻人多生孩子，\n还是希望年轻人少读点书？\n😱😱😱", "url": "https://x.com/pnsin1/status/2118919080006819878"}, {"author_id": "1614847677048524800", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118925158736159109"], "id": "2118925158736159109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 326, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "最近观察一组数据：全球穆斯林每年出生人口为5000万。\n\n许多穆斯林国家虽已开始控制或反对童婚，但6至9岁结婚者仍大有人在。\n\n如视频中的女孩，约12岁即已怀孕。\n\n此生育率确实无法相比。 https://t.co/2Vovve70Qj", "url": "https://x.com/GuiGui0vo/status/2118925158736159109"}, {"author_id": "1255884238265540608", "created_at": "2026-11-06T11:33:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118667964052595025"], "id": "2118667964052595025", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 177, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "幼兒園改養老院為何難？審批繁瑣、改造成本成轉型障礙\n\n大陸出生人口下降、幼兒園生源銳減，部分園所轉型養老機構卻受阻。土地用途、消防審批及高昂改造成本，加上護理人力與入住率問題，讓轉型之路困難重重。https://t.co/xFX3C7LP4j", "url": "https://x.com/dajiyuan2/status/2118667964052595025"}, {"author_id": "874227344881451009", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:42:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118700449079697594"], "id": "2118700449079697594", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1657, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118455028738375887", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "美国威斯康星大学麦迪逊分校人口统计学家易富贤@fuxianyi 在接受美国之音采访时表示，这意味着2027年的出生人口数量将暴跌。易富贤说：“因为结婚与下一年的出生数是高度相关的，这就意味着2027年的中国出生数会非常快速地下降。” https://t.co/Xvxrlfks5f", "url": "https://x.com/VOAXinxin/status/2118700449079697594"}, {"author_id": "1530521140049100800", "created_at": "2026-11-06T18:34:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118774073266467262"], "id": "2118774073266467262", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 250, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全球整体并不是男女各占50%，而是男性约占50.3%，女性约占49.7%\n\n出生人口中，通常每100个女孩对应约105个男孩\n\n在人类出生时给男性一点数量优势，却又通过男性更高的死亡率，让成年后的人口比例逐渐接近，真是造化之妙，叹为观止", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoxielaile/status/2118774073266467262"}, {"author_id": "1224562493625815040", "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:57:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118538161093853656"], "id": "2118538161093853656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "民政部数据：今年前三季度结婚登记464.8万对，比去年同期少50.4万对，跌9.8%。去年刚反弹一下，今年又掉头。2025年出生人口792万，比前一年少17%。育儿补贴、学前减免都发了，年轻人还是不结。\n 老周认为：房价跌、工作难，彩礼高，女权盛行都是问题\n 要不要取消彩礼？", "url": "https://x.com/king_of_options/status/2118538161093853656"}, {"author_id": "1397433341901565956", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:41:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504079542702080"], "id": "2118504079542702080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽！！真的没人愿意结婚了！！\n\n2026年前三季度\n\n结婚登记只有464.8万对\n\n同比少了50.4万\n\n一季度跌6.2%\n\n二季度跌8.7%\n\n三季度直接跌14.9%！！\n\n降幅越来越大\n\n人口学家说\n\n结婚和下一年出生数高度相关！\n\n那意味着2027年出生人口要暴跌了！！\n\n你们觉得后面会发生什么？？！\n\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/Humb1eSwag/status/2118504079542702080"}, {"author_id": "1305905708018348032", "created_at": "2026-11-06T03:08:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118540993016242207"], "id": "2118540993016242207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4365, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国大陆前三季度结婚登记464.8万对，降至18年来同期最低\n\n中国大陆今年前三季度结婚登记464.8万对，比去年同期减少50.4万对，降幅约9.8%。第一财经报道，这是18年来前三季度的最低水平。 https://t.co/i1sRsgTy2R", "url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2118540993016242207"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "203601609040559